#: kcmtaskbar.cpp:251
msgid ""
"<h1>Taskbar</h1> You can configure the taskbar here. This includes options "
"such as whether or not the taskbar should show all windows at once or only "
"those on the current desktop. You can also configure whether or not the "
"Window List button will be displayed."
msgstr ""
"<h1>Bar Tasgau</h1> Gallwch ffurfweddu'r bar tasgau yma. Mae hwn yn cynnwys "
"dewisiadau megis a ddylai'r bar tasgau ddangos bob ffenestr ar yr un pryd, "
"neu dim ond y rhai ar y penbwrdd cyfredol. Gallwch hefyd ffurfweddu a ddylid "
"dangos y botwm Rhestr Ffenestri ai peidio."

#: rc.cpp:2
#, no-c-format
msgid "Taskbar"
msgstr "Bar Tasgau"

#: rc.cpp:4
#, no-c-format
msgid "&Taskbar"
msgstr "Bar &Tasgau"

#: rc.cpp:6
#, no-c-format
msgid "&Show windows from all desktops"
msgstr "&Dangos ffenestri o bob penbwrdd"

#: rc.cpp:8
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Uncheck this option if you want the taskbar to only display the windows on "
"the current desktop. By default, all existing windows are shown."
msgstr ""
"Brithwch y dewisiad yma os ydych am i'r bar tasgau ddangos ffenestri sydd ar "
"y penbwrdd cyfredol yn unig. Yn ragosod, dengys y bar tasgau bob ffenestr "
"gyfredol."

#: rc.cpp:10
#, no-c-format
msgid "Show window list &button"
msgstr "Dangos &botwm rhestr ffenestri"

#: rc.cpp:12
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Check this option if you want the taskbar to display a small popup which "
"gives you easy access to all applications on other desktops and some further "
"options."
msgstr ""
"Brithwch y dewisiad yma os ydych am i'r bar tasgau ddangos naidlen fach sy'n "
"rhoi hygyrchedd hwylus i'ch holl gymhwysiadau ar benbyrddau eraill a rhai "
"dewisiadau pellach."

#: rc.cpp:14
#, no-c-format
msgid "Sort tas&ks by virtual desktop"
msgstr "Trefnu tas&gau yn ôl rhith-benbyrddau"

#: rc.cpp:16
#, no-c-format
msgid "Check this option if you want the taskbar to sort task buttons by desktop."
msgstr ""
"Brithwch y dewisiad yma os ydych am i'r bar tasgau drefnu botymau tasgau yn "
"ôl eu penbyrddau."

#: rc.cpp:18
#, no-c-format
msgid "Sho&w application icons"
msgstr "Dango&s eiconau cymhwysiadau"

#: rc.cpp:20
#, no-c-format
msgid "Check this option if you want to display the applications icon in the taskbar"
msgstr ""
"Brithwch y dewisiad yma os ydych am ddangos eiconau cymhwysiadau yn y bar "
"tasgau"

#: rc.cpp:22
#, no-c-format
msgid "Show o&nly minimized windows"
msgstr "Dangos ffenestri wedi'u lleihau yn u&nig"

#: rc.cpp:24
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Check this option if you want the taskbar to display only windows which are "
"minimized. By default, the taskbar will show all windows."
msgstr ""
"Brithwch y dewisiad yma os ydych am i'r bar tasgau ddangos ffenestri sydd "
"wedi'u lleihau'n unig. Yn ragosod, dengys y bar tasgau bob ffenestr."

#: rc.cpp:26
#, no-c-format
msgid "&Group similar tasks:"
msgstr "&Casglu tasgau tebyg:"

#: rc.cpp:28
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Check this option if you want the taskbar to hold all running instances of "
"one application in one taskbutton. Clicking on the button for some seconds "
"will unfold a menu which shows all instances of the application. This is "
"especially useful with the \"<strong>Show all windows</strong>\" option."
msgstr ""
"Brithwch y dewisiad yma os ydych am i'r bar tasgau gadw bob enghraifft "
"rhedol o un cymhwysiad mewn un botwm tasgau. Bydd clicio ar y botwm am rai "
"eiliadau yn datblygu dewislen sy'n dangos holl enghreifftiau'r cymhwysiad. "
"Mae hyn yn arbennig o ddefnyddiol â'r dewisiad \"<strong>Dangos bob "
"ffenestr</strong>\"."

#: rc.cpp:30
#, no-c-format
msgid "Actions"
msgstr "Gweithredoedd"

#: rc.cpp:32
#, no-c-format
msgid "&Left button:"
msgstr "Botwm chw&ith:"

#: rc.cpp:34
#, no-c-format
msgid "&Middle button:"
msgstr "Botwm &Canol:"

#: rc.cpp:36
#, no-c-format
msgid "Right b&utton:"
msgstr "B&otwm Dde"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Check this option if you want the taskbar to display all of the existing "
#~ "windows at once. By default, the taskbar will only show those windows "
#~ "that are on the current desktop."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Brithwch y dewisiad yma os ydych am i'r bar tasgau ddangos bob ffenestr "
#~ "sy'n bodoli ar unwaith. Yn ragosod, dengys y bar tasgau'r ffenestri sydd "
#~ "ar y penbwrdd cyfredol yn unig."
